abstract: >-
  A browser-only teaching demo (AI Teaching Demos): a browser-only teaching demo of Shengji ("upgrade", one-deck 80-points variant): automatic trump declaration, trump ranking, follow-suit, point cards, buried bottom ×2, level changes and dealer rotation across a full match. The JavaScript engine reproduces the Python engine move-by-move; AIs are rule-based and a side panel explains each greedy decision.
